# Copy to .env.local for development. Nothing in this file is read
# automatically — .env.example is a template, not a config file.
#
# On Vercel these live in Project → Settings → Environment Variables,
# not in a file. See docs/deployment.md.

# ── Contact form (required for /contact to work) ────────────────────────
# A Notion internal integration secret. Create it at
# https://www.notion.so/my-integrations, then open the enquiries database
# in Notion and share it with that integration — a token alone is not
# enough, the database has to be connected to it.
#
# Without this the form returns a visible error and shows the mailto
# fallback. It does not silently drop messages.
NOTION_TOKEN=ntn_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# The Notion database enquiries are written to. Optional: the ID of the
# database created for this site is the default, in app/api/contact/route.ts.
# Set this only to point the form at a different database.
# NOTION_ENQUIRIES_DB=cb5dcc82c01647c686cbbd8109f27c2d

# ── Canonical URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Overrides the production domain when resolving canonical links and
# Open Graph image URLs. Leave unset in production; the default is
# https://infinitesofteware.com (app/layout.tsx).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://preview.example.com
